# Task Intent Routing

Перед правками: интент (`planning` | `architecture` | `bugfix` | `feature` | `refactor` | `performance` | `api` | `database` | `docs` | `infra/ci`).

**Docs before code:** для `feature`, `refactor`, `bugfix`, `api`, `database`, `architecture` — сначала обновить SoT-docs, затем код (`documentation-first.mdc` § gate). Исключения — только там же.

## Маршрутизация

- `planning`: `documentation-first.mdc`, `token-economy.mdc`, `architecture-gates.mdc`; при межмодульных связях / Service/Repository / `src/` → `modular-monolith-boundaries.mdc`
- `architecture`: `architecture-gates.mdc`, `modular-monolith-boundaries.mdc`, `architecture-decision-log.mdc`, `high-risk-review-packet.mdc`, `risk-scoring-and-review-depth.mdc`, `definition-of-done-gates.mdc`
- `bugfix`: `documentation-first.mdc`, `testing-and-testcases.mdc`, `lint-scoped-checks.mdc`, `code-quality-gates.mdc`, `definition-of-done-gates.mdc`; при затронутом API → `api-contract-gate.mdc`, `deprecation-and-backward-compatibility.mdc`
- `feature`: `documentation-first.mdc`, `testing-and-testcases.mdc`, `code-quality-gates.mdc`, `definition-of-done-gates.mdc` + project i18n/stack rules; backend path → `highload-io-memory.mdc`, `highload-resilience-deps.mdc`; при затронутом API → `api-contract-gate.mdc`, `deprecation-and-backward-compatibility.mdc`; при межмодульных связях / Service/Repository / `src/` → `modular-monolith-boundaries.mdc`
- `refactor`: `documentation-first.mdc`, `code-cleanliness.mdc`, skill `code-quality-review`, `code-quality-gates.mdc`, `lint-scoped-checks.mdc`, `risk-scoring-and-review-depth.mdc`; при затронутом API → `api-contract-gate.mdc`, `deprecation-and-backward-compatibility.mdc`; при межмодульных связях / Service/Repository / `src/` → `modular-monolith-boundaries.mdc`
- `performance`: `algorithm-complexity-selection.mdc`, `highload-io-memory.mdc`, `highload-resilience-deps.mdc`, `high-risk-review-packet.mdc`, `risk-scoring-and-review-depth.mdc`
- `api`: `api-contract-gate.mdc`, `deprecation-and-backward-compatibility.mdc`, `highload-io-memory.mdc`, `highload-resilience-deps.mdc`, `high-risk-review-packet.mdc`, `testing-and-testcases.mdc`, `code-quality-gates.mdc`
- `database`: `migrations-doc-and-notify.mdc`, `deprecation-and-backward-compatibility.mdc`, `highload-io-memory.mdc`, `high-risk-review-packet.mdc`, `testing-and-testcases.mdc`; при затронутом API/DTO → `api-contract-gate.mdc`

**API primacy:** существующий контракт не менять без явного указания пользователя; при конфликте — вопрос + варианты (см. `api-contract-gate.mdc` §0).
- `docs`: `documentation-first.mdc`, `token-economy.mdc`
- `infra/ci`: `ci-cd.mdc`, `code-quality-gates.mdc`, `secrets-and-env.mdc`

**Стек** (React, backend, vanilla HTML, …) — **только project rules** (`project-rules-scope.mdc`).  
**Домен** (СБИС, YooKassa, …) — project skills / domain rules, не global.

## Фиксация

`Intent` | `Risk` (low/medium/high) | `Activated rules/skills`
